  "summary": "Install-time host reconnaissance beacon to hardcoded bare IP",
  "details": "package.json declares preinstall and postinstall lifecycle hooks that run curl against http://54.37.234.136/voicemail over plain HTTP, sending the installer's username (whoami), hostname, current working directory, and a timestamp as query parameters. This fires automatically on `npm install`, exfiltrating installer host identity to a hardcoded attacker-controlled bare IP endpoint. The package has no substantive code or documented purpose beyond this beacon, consistent with a reconnaissance drop.",
